This learning path include 100 carefully curated SQL problems created by Ankit Bansal as part of his Udemy course '100 Days of SQL'.
Each day brings a short, SQL question from scratch with the aim of practising Complex SQLs, improve problem solving skills by using 
multiple ways to solve a SQL problem. The problems covered in this course is suitable for 
Data Analyst,Data Engineer,Data Scientist,Business Intelligence Engineers,Business Analyst,SQL Developer,ETL Developer,AI Engineers
